      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "All Envato Elements assets are used under a valid single-use commercial
    license, \nwith license certificates properly stored.\n\nGenerative AI is used
    to validate player input, generate the detective\u2019s deductions, \nand evaluate
    the final conclusion.\nGenerative AI was used to create initial background visual
    concepts, \nwhich were then sketched over and redrawn by hand to produce the
    final artwork.\n\r\n"
