    Fun Cartoon Fail \u2014 applehillstudios (Envato Elements, commercial license)\r\n-
    UI Button Paper Mid Tap Small Swipe Short Marker Pen Scratch 01 \u2014 Ghetty
    (Envato Elements, commercial license)\r\n- Capture \u2014 Cinematic-Sound-Design
    (Envato Elements, commercial license)\r\n- Paper Impact \u2014 TibaSFX (Envato
    Elements, commercial license)\r\n- People are conversing quietly in a small group
    \u2014 VadiSoundLibrary (Envato Elements, commercial license)\r\n- Male Adult
    Idle Mildly Annoyed Apathetic Response 01 \u2014 Ghetty (Envato Elements, commercial
    license)\r\n- Pet Parrot Squawks \u2014 HollywoodEdge (Envato Elements, commercial
    license)\r\n- Approval Stamp \u2014 Top-Up-Sounds (Envato Elements, commercial
